(4. Payment rules) Tj T*
(Tuition is due by the 10th of every month.) Tj T*
(A late fee of 500 PKR is charged if tuition is paid after the 10th of the month.) Tj T*
(If fees are unpaid for two months, the student's name may be struck off the rolls.) Tj T*
(Fees can be paid by bank transfer or at the school accounts office.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Discounts) Tj T*
(Sibling discount: the second child receives 10% off tuition, the third child 15%.) Tj T*
(Paying the full year's tuition in advance by 31 August gives a 5% discount.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Refunds) Tj T*
(The admission fee is non-refundable.) Tj T*
(Tuition paid in advance is refunded for full unused months if one month's notice is given.) Tj T*
